Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🐷 1 lb marinated pork (achiote, 🍎 pineapple juice, 🌶️ chili), 🫓 small corn tortillas, 🧅 1/2 cup diced white onion, 🌿 1/2 cup fresh cilantro, 🍎 1/2 cup diced pineapple, and salsa verde. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Sear the marinated pork in a very hot pan until the edges are crispy and caramelized. 🥣 Char the pineapple slices. 🔥 Warm the corn tortillas on a griddle. ⏲️ Assemble by piling pork onto tortillas, topping with onion, cilantro, and a piece of sweet pineapple. 🍳 Serve with a side of spicy green salsa and lime.
