Caption: 🍅 The Ultimate Heirloom Tomato BLT 🍅
Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🧂 4 slices thick-cut peppered bacon, 🥨 2 slices toasted sourdough, 🍅 1 large heirloom tomato, 🥬 crisp bibb lettuce, 🥛 and 2 tbsp high-quality mayonnaise. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Fry the bacon until perfectly crispy but not burnt. 🥣 Slice the tomato into 1/2 inch thick rounds and season with salt and pepper. 🔥 Spread a thick layer of mayo on both slices of toasted bread. ⏲️ Layer the lettuce, the juicy tomato slices, and then the bacon. 🍳 Close the sandwich and slice diagonally.
#blt #sandwich #lunch #bacon #classic #easyrecipes #foodie #tomato 🌮🍱'
